# Nexora environment configuration — copy to `.env` and fill in values.
# `.env` is gitignored; never commit real keys.

# --- Respan tracing (server-side only — see server/tracing.ts) ---
# Gates LLM tracing. Tracing stays OFF when unset: the app runs exactly as
# before (dev and CI need no key). Set it only where spans should be exported.
RESPAN_API_KEY=

# Optional: point the Respan SDK at a non-default collector endpoint.
# RESPAN_BASE_URL=
